<title>BELGIUM: EU SAYS CLEARS MOTOROLA'S IRIDIUM.</title>
<headline>EU SAYS CLEARS MOTOROLA'S IRIDIUM.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Thursday it had cleared the creation of Iridium, a satellite communications system led by Motorola Inc .</p>
</text>
